  "title": "Update quote details"
 },
 "description": "Adds or changes details on a quote: people, drivers, vehicles, the property, coverages, discounts, prior insurance, and policy terms. The patch schema lists every field Libertas accepts. Safe to call repeatedly; the latest value for a field wins, and lists replace earlier lists. Returns which fields were applied, which were rejected and why, and whether the quote has enough to run.\n\nCredit scores, driving and claims records, and decoded vehicle or public-record property details come straight from data providers, so they aren't accepted here, and carrier choice is made by the rating engine.\n\nIf the customer changes a coverage after prices come back, apply it here and call get_quote_options again; re-quoting is free and takes about a minute. Coverage choices are the customer's, and a licensed Libertas agent can advise on what limits make sense.",
